  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<!--Do not edit this div tag.  It must surround the interaction block-->
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="3b03d196-7526-4071-b198-999c2e4d4c08"><problem><para>
      <para>Match each equation with a verbal description that represents the same function.</para>
      <para>\(f(x)=2x+4\)</para>
      </para></problem><solution><para>To get the output, multiply the input by 2, then add 4 to the result.</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is to get the output, multiply the input by 2, then add 4 to the result. </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
